# Measured before the fix: `[run] end complete steps=40 … exit 0`, NO `checkpoint degraded` item, and stderr printing
# `files`, `resume` and `report` rows for a directory that did not exist. After: one `checkpoint degraded: ENOENT on
# state.json — …` item, `state.json missing — not resumable`, the `files` row replaced by the `gone` sentence, exit 3.
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Say hi
sleep 0.3
send fix the failing test
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect step \d+/\d+
expect checkpoint degraded
expect not resumable
sleep 0.4
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
